# Windows batch files need CRLF line endings (cmd can lose a label in a file with LF only).
# Only Mehteran's own launchers: the translation app's launchers (translate.cmd, scripts/start.cmd, Open Interface.bat)
# are left as they are.
/mehter.cmd text eol=crlf
/scripts/mehter.cmd text eol=crlf
/Open?Mehteran.bat text eol=crlf
